  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T02:21:56.649962Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T03:00:27.934903Z",
  "totalBlocks": 118,
  "translatedBlocks": 86,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6acb9fb919195ddb",
      "translationZh": "训练模型理解和预测人类偏好可能极其复杂。监督微调等传统方法通常需要为数据分配特定标签，这种做法的成本效益不高，尤其是在处理需要细致判断的任务时。偏好优化是另一种方法，可以简化这一过程，并产生更准确的结果。偏好优化侧重于比较候选答案并对其排序，而不是分配固定标签，因此能让模型更有效地捕捉人类判断中的细微差别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a9ccfa5520a9891",
      "translationZh": "偏好优化广泛用于语言模型的微调，但也可以应用于视觉语言模型（VLM）。我们很高兴地宣布，TRL 库现已支持对 VLM 进行直接偏好优化（DPO）。本文将指导你完成使用 TRL 和 DPO 训练 VLM 的过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b5281eaf2c4fc8e",
      "translationZh": "偏好数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7764bb8866d258cf",
      "translationZh": "偏好优化需要能够反映用户偏好的数据。在二元选择设置中，每个样本都包含一个提示和两个候选答案：一个被选中的答案和一个被拒绝的答案。模型的目标是学会预测被选中的答案比被拒绝的答案更受偏好。例如，你需要准备如下样本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ac403b0da92f6db",
      "translationZh": "图片来自 openbmb/RLAIF-V-Dataset",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12c0ed94e73942e1",
      "translationZh": "❔ 问题：有多少个家庭？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c678266c2c933d97",
      "translationZh": "❌ 被拒绝的答案：图片未提供任何有关家庭的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "077de8fce9b963f1",
      "translationZh": "✅ 被选中的答案：图片展示了一个联合组织的桌台布置，上面标有 18,000 个家庭。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a36149b889519a2c",
      "translationZh": "请注意，被选中的消息不一定正确。例如，那个声称有 18,000 个家庭的被选中回答仍然是错的，只不过与被拒绝的回答相比，错得少一些。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ae8a6d937403600",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们将使用 openbmb/RLAIF-V-Dataset，其中包含超过 83,000 行已标注数据。让我们更仔细地看看这个数据集：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f62d32e59d6b23d7",
      "translationZh": "我们的模型需要同时接收文本和图像作为输入，因此第一步是调整数据集的格式，以满足这一要求。数据的结构应模拟用户与助手之间的对话。用户提供包含图像和问题的提示，助手则给出回答。具体的格式调整方式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3acbf9bfba08a077",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们的数据集已经完成格式调整。让我们看看第一个示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f805607dcc169fbe",
      "translationZh": "让你的 GPU 热身吧，数据集已经准备好，可以开始训练了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36a798e3f39239cc",
      "translationZh": "训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "771cf464388f1bfd",
      "translationZh": "在本示例中，我们将训练 Idefics2-8b 模型，但请注意，TRL 中的 DPO 实现也支持 Llava 1.5 和 PaliGemma 等其他模型。更多信息请参阅“微调 Llava 1.5、PaliGemma 及其他模型”一节。在深入了解训练过程之前，我们首先要确保所有内容都能顺利装入内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0cc2e2616cbc5ace",
      "translationZh": "我需要多少内存？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e584ea314e99add",
      "translationZh": "我有一块显存为 80GB 的 GPU。这足够训练我的 Idefics2-8b 模型吗？以下是粗略估算所需内存的计算步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9239728a019800a",
      "translationZh": "设 N N N 为参数数量，P P P 为精度。以下组成部分必须能够同时放入内存中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5ebf5cd5bba0484",
      "translationZh": "待训练模型：N×P N \\times P N×P",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac12b20b05fc98a3",
      "translationZh": "参考模型：参考模型与待训练模型相同，因此也需要 N×P N \\times P N×P",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cec7585e67e6e971",
      "translationZh": "梯度：我们训练整个模型，每个参数都需要一个梯度，因此需要 N×P N \\times P N×P",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8bd05cbcd3dc2c54",
      "translationZh": "优化器状态：我们使用 AdamW，它为每个参数维护两个状态，因此需要 2×N×P 2 \\times N \\times P 2×N×P",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e90e1739d8f06c4",
      "translationZh": "Idefics2-8b 有 80 亿个参数，我们使用 float32 精度，每个浮点数需要 4 字节。因此，所需的总内存为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce54f0e22dbb39de",
      "translationZh": "组成部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "025194fba737d248",
      "translationZh": "计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3963aedaac6c83c",
      "translationZh": "内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9619fc4a72305db5",
      "translationZh": "待训练模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a30ee3f7a9793586",
      "translationZh": "参考模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab64614fdfe4f15b",
      "translationZh": "梯度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b19aa999df68afda",
      "translationZh": "优化器状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9b3c38247f744e1",
      "translationZh": "总计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a59dea4f7fe053f",
      "translationZh": "这远远超出了我的 GPU 显存容量。幸运的是，通过应用量化和 LoRA 等技术，我们可以显著降低显存需求，让训练变得可行。让我们看看具体该怎么做。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a3e4d9d8b7ebe9c2",
      "translationZh": "量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dfb2c2264316f21",
      "translationZh": "量化是一种降低模型权重和激活值精度的技术。从 float32 精度切换到 bfloat16 精度，可将每个参数的存储需求减半，从 4 字节降至 2 字节。这种优化既节省内存，又能加速计算，以极小的代价保持高性能。要在模型中使用 bfloat16 精度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e3a7ac2bb225d5d",
      "translationZh": "通过在训练参数中设置 bf16=True，也可以将 bfloat16 精度应用于优化器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4b7465cf642ae94",
      "translationZh": "LoRA 是一种通过学习成对的秩分解矩阵来减少可训练参数数量的方法，同时保持原始权重冻结。这大幅降低了针对特定任务进行适配的 LLM 的存储需求。LoRA 已集成到 PEFT 中，你可以很快完成设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dce0d9c39570eb59",
      "translationZh": "PEFT 就像包裹在模型外部的一层封装（称为 adaptater）。训练的就是这个适配器，而内部模型则保持冻结。LoRA 能将可训练参数的数量减少多少呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fec5c6c267978856",
      "translationZh": "它将可训练参数的数量从 80 亿减少到 5500 万，差距非常大，而且这将显著降低显存需求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2a1fe5afc4ab7b6c",
      "translationZh": "量化和 LoRA 后的新内存需求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd467c34c8daff6e",
      "translationZh": "现在我们已经降低了内存需求，让我们重新计算所需的内存：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce54f0e22dbb39de",
      "translationZh": "组成部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "025194fba737d248",
      "translationZh": "计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3963aedaac6c83c",
      "translationZh": "内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9619fc4a72305db5",
      "translationZh": "待训练模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a30ee3f7a9793586",
      "translationZh": "参考模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab64614fdfe4f15b",
      "translationZh": "梯度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b19aa999df68afda",
      "translationZh": "优化器状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9b3c38247f744e1",
      "translationZh": "总计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c4a11475930ea5c",
      "translationZh": "这次，我们需要大约 32GB 的内存来微调 Idefics2-8b 模型，这合理多了，我的 GPU 也能容纳得下！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "023fc03510c9abdc",
      "translationZh": "有关使用 LoRA 和 QLoRA 优化内存使用的更多信息，请参阅 PEFT 文档，或 Google 针对 LLM 的 LoRA 和 QLoRA 建议。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e5d8753f5eb989bc",
      "translationZh": "批大小该如何设置？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2913ef678cce779",
      "translationZh": "我们的内存计算并不精确，因为它没有考虑激活值。激活值是网络层的中间输出，其内存需求取决于模型结构和批大小。精确计算激活值所需的内存很有挑战性，因此我们将依靠实际观察。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e89f5eacf996d7d",
      "translationZh": "要选择合适的训练批大小（per_device_train_batch_size），先从你期望的批大小（例如 64）开始。这很可能会导致内存不足（OOM）错误。如果发生这种情况，就将批大小减半，并将梯度累积步数（gradient_accumulation_steps）加倍，以保持相同的有效批大小。重复此过程，直到内存需求不超过 GPU 的显存容量。在我们的例子中，最终的批大小为 2，梯度累积步数为 32。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58b299df60fc5d63",
      "translationZh": "另一项优化是使用梯度检查点（gradient_checkpointing）来减少存储激活值所需的内存。这项技术通过在反向传播过程中重新计算网络的部分内容，以额外计算换取内存节省。可以在训练参数中设置 gradient_checkpointing=True 来启用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b6a81b2044f6e0e5",
      "translationZh": "总结：完整的训练脚本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00bb756a782a8724",
      "translationZh": "现在我们已经设置好模型、数据集和训练参数，可以开始训练了。下面展示如何将所有内容整合到一个脚本中，其中还包括一些用于加快处理速度的额外设置，例如 dataset_num_proc 和 dataloader_num_workers：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43668b2e2a70d6ce",
      "translationZh": "运行起来，然后等待吧……🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f22850f30aa66d3a",
      "translationZh": "几个小时后，训练完成了。让我们来看看训练曲线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b710d4c48996fce2",
      "translationZh": "在 DPO 中，我们重点关注以下几个指标，以评估训练质量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4994036cc3989d0",
      "translationZh": "准确率：这个指标表示，在训练样本中，模型输出优选答案的可能性高于输出被拒绝答案的可能性的样本所占的百分比。我们可以看到准确率有所提高，这是一个积极的信号。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "670415a3f799b9d1",
      "translationZh": "奖励：奖励与答案被选中的概率有关。更多详情请参阅 DPO 论文第 5 节。我们期望被选中答案的奖励高于被拒绝答案的奖励。为了验证这一点，我们关注奖励差值，即被选中答案与被拒绝答案的奖励之差。正如此处观察到的那样，奖励差值不断增大也是一个好迹象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "163e44b102626149",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae5b8a4c6ac9aa79",
      "translationZh": "推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "795553964a0f1e03",
      "translationZh": "模型训练完成后，下一步是在一些示例上评估其性能。这将让我们了解模型学得如何，以及它能多有效地进行预测。下面的脚本可以帮助你评估模型，并分析其在一组测试示例上的表现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccb190c97f751c84",
      "translationZh": "如上所述，openbmb/RLAIF-V-Dataset 旨在减少幻觉。但微调是否真的减少了幻觉？为了弄清这一点，我们可以使用 AMBER 基准，这是一个专门为评估视觉语言模型（VLMs）中的幻觉而创建的数据集。我们将报告 Idefics2 和 Idefics2+DPO 在判别任务上的结果，并与其他模型进行比较，以供参考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac991dd3c2d928da",
      "translationZh": "准确率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f52dffce1217f660",
      "translationZh": "少即是多",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72937eb8348e867c",
      "translationZh": "总体而言，微调后的模型似乎产生的幻觉少了一些。看来训练成功了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6b7af5d819dd1a2",
      "translationZh": "以下是一些精心挑选的示例，用于展示模型的表现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1aa4cb0bcca76e92",
      "translationZh": "图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "289aff12b04274cb",
      "translationZh": "问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a479e0355a388cc5",
      "translationZh": "这张图中有两艘船吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85a39ab345d672ff",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea442a134b2a184",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f54221aec16bb362",
      "translationZh": "这张图中的地面不平整吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea442a134b2a184",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85a39ab345d672ff",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e0d87f8403731f9",
      "translationZh": "这张图中有一把铲子吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85a39ab345d672ff",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea442a134b2a184",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a72890e7da8e04b",
      "translationZh": "亲自试一试，看看模型在你自己的示例上表现如何！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "774ee12e560ead65",
      "translationZh": "微调 Llava 1.5、PaliGemma 及其他模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cee0b00d9a1abd7",
      "translationZh": "截至撰写本文时，TRL 中的 DPO 实现支持 Idefics2、Llava 1.5 和 PaliGemma，并且仍在持续努力添加对更多模型的支持。微调这些模型最简单的方法是使用 TRL 仓库中提供的示例脚本。例如，要微调 PaliGemma，你可以使用以下命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2efca2c427f2b099",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 smol-vision 项目中找到专门针对 PaliGemma 微调的详细介绍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ae538fbdab8c03d",
      "translationZh": "🚀🚀 现在，你已经具备了使用 DPO 开始微调自己的 VLMs 所需的一切。与社区分享你的发现、模型和数据集吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
